      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182557\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182557\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Roof sheathing shall be in accordance with <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-181750', hash: '#JD_BCTable2304.8(3)' }}\">Tables 2304.8(3)<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-181750', hash: '#JD_BCTable2304.8(5)' }}\">2304.8(5)<\/Link> for wood structural panels, and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-181750', hash: '#JD_BCTable2304.8(1)' }}\">Tables 2304.8(1)<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-181750', hash: '#JD_BCTable2304.8(2)' }}\">2304.8(2)<\/Link> for lumber and shall comply with Section 2304.8.2. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182558\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182558\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>(Am. L.L. 2023\/077, 6\/11\/2023, eff. 6\/11\/2023) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-224434\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-224434\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:<\/span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-224061', hash: '#JD_L.L.2023\/077' }}\">L.L. 2023\/077<\/Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "5084-html-1",
